[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4803.722, "timestamp": "01:20:03", "text": "不，那就选第一个吧。非常好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4808.733, "timestamp": "01:20:08", "text": "当时机临近时，我们将启程。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4819.858, "timestamp": "01:20:19", "text": "这种舒适感。好的。 7分钟。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4825.207, "timestamp": "01:20:25", "text": "不，不。 6分钟。你好。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4839.411, "timestamp": "01:20:39", "text": "今天我完成了我的任务，我必须……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4846.946, "timestamp": "01:20:46", "text": "听听这个。哦，对了，坐下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4848.987, "timestamp": "01:20:48", "text": "如果还没写愿望，可以自由写下来。"}]